    "text": "By BakersfieldNow Staff ,\n10 hours ago BAKERSFIELD, Calif. (KBAK/KBFX) — The California Board of Parole Hearings denied release to a man convicted of burning a woman with a hot clothes iron back in 2009. The DA’s office said BPH found 55-year-old Henry Cartwright III continues to pose a current and unreasonable risk to public safety. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 8",
